error[E4102]: cannot assign to `c.value` because it is borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4102_reborrow_suspends_original.tarn:33:5
   |
32 |     r := &mut c.value
   |          ------------ mutable borrow of `c.value` starts here
33 |     c.value = 1               // writing through `c` while `r` still borrows it
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^ assigned here while borrowed
34 |     print(r)
   |           - the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

